# inc-h5aql AC10: configure the weapon sets through the inventory-screen keys,
# then Save and Continue. The loaded fixture already holds M (sword, dagger
# off-hand) and R (bow). Add X (longspear), S (knife, kite shield off-hand) and
# the ammo (shotputs). No one-handed reach weapon exists for a Medium character,
# so X has no off-hand item here.
@until "SPACE:Swap" i
e X
0 1
S
0 5
O
@choose "Short set (S)"
0 2
A
@dump:cfg-inventory
@until "Things in View" ESC
ESC
b
.*2
@dump:cfg-saved
@quit
